@startuml
title Sequence - UC-08 Tự động tạo lộ trình & lịch trình
actor "Admin Dashboard" as AdminUI
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Trip & Route Service" as TripSvc
participant "Spark Batch Jobs" as Spark
participant "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Map/Traffic API" as MapAPI
database "DB" as DB

AdminUI -> API : POST /routing/auto-plan/run
API -> Auth : validate admin token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> Kafka : publish auto-plan command

Spark -> Kafka : consume command
Spark -> DB : load approved stops
DB --> Spark : stops
Spark -> MapAPI : fetch distance matrix
MapAPI --> Spark : matrix
Spark -> Spark: optimize routes & schedule
Spark -> DB : write route candidates & schedule
Spark -> Kafka : publish plan result

Kafka -> TripSvc : new plan event
TripSvc -> DB : persist routes/trips
TripSvc --> API : plan ready
API --> AdminUI : present options (A,B,...)

== Điều chỉnh thủ công ==
AdminUI -> API : PATCH /routing/auto-plan/tweak (order/time)
API -> Auth : validate admin token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> TripSvc : apply tweaks & validate constraints
TripSvc -> DB : read/write affected routes
DB --> TripSvc : ok
TripSvc --> API : updated options
API --> AdminUI : present updated options

== Phê duyệt ==
AdminUI -> API : POST /routing/auto-plan/approve
API -> Auth : validate admin token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> TripSvc : approve plan
TripSvc -> DB : mark plan APPROVED; store finalized routes
TripSvc -> Kafka : publish plan events
Kafka --> TripSvc : ack
TripSvc --> API : ok
API --> AdminUI : plan approved

note over AdminUI
end note
@enduml